{{ figure("sweep", wide=True) }}

{{ landscape_end() }}

**Decision.** The capacity policy is the one to deploy if the caps are real. It uses the per-region caps
directly, while `top_share` only respects them on average. Both are valued on the test outlets in Part 8.

