**Which rows.** {{ n.interpret_rows | vnd }} test rows where every arm has evidence by the trained model's
propensities (Part 9 used the referee's, hence a slightly different count), sampled down to 20,000. Modern
trade is left out: its display and rep effects are extrapolations and would dominate every number. The shadow
